<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Foocus Ag</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  :root { --coral:#FF5C4D; --blue:#0066FF; --lime:#B8FF00; --black:#0A0A0A; --cream:#F5F0E8; --gray:#1A1A1A; --gray2:#2A2A2A; }
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;background:var(--black);color:var(--cream);overflow-x:hidden;}
  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;}

  /* NAV */
  nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1.2rem 2.5rem;background:rgba(10,10,10,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);}
  .logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.4rem;letter-spacing:-.5px;}
  .logo span{color:var(--coral);}
  .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.8rem;list-style:none;}
  .nav-links a{color:rgba(245,240,232,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:500;transition:color .2s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--cream);}
  .lang-toggle{background:var(--gray2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:20px;padding:4px;display:flex;gap:2px;}
  .lang-btn{background:none;border:none;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
  .lang-btn.active{background:var(--coral);color:white;}

  /* HERO */
  #hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:8rem 2.5rem 5rem;background:var(--black);position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .hero-bg{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 70% 50%,rgba(0,102,255,.12) 0%,transparent 70%),radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 20% 80%,rgba(255,92,77,.1) 0%,transparent 60%);pointer-events:none;}
  .hero-tag{display:inline-block;background:rgba(184,255,0,.12);border:1px solid var(--lime);color:var(--lime);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:1.8rem;}
  .hero-title{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,6rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-2px;max-width:800px;}
  .hero-title .accent{color:var(--coral);}
  .hero-title .accent2{color:var(--blue);}
  .hero-sub{margin-top:1.5rem;font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.2rem);color:rgba(245,240,232,.65);max-width:520px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:300;}
  .hero-ctas{margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--coral);color:white;border:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;display:inline-block;}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#ff3d2e;transform:translateY(-1px);}
  .btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--cream);border:1px solid rgba(245,240,232,.25);padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;display:inline-block;}
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--cream);background:rgba(245,240,232,.05);}
  .hero-stats{margin-top:4rem;display:flex;gap:3rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .stat-num{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--lime);}
  .stat-label{font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);margin-top:2px;}

  /* SECTIONS */
  section{padding:6rem 2.5rem;}
  .section-label{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--coral);margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .section-title{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1px;}
  .section-sub{margin-top:.8rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.55);font-size:1rem;max-width:500px;line-height:1.6;}
  .max-w{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;}

  /* SERVICES */
  #services{background:var(--gray);}
  .services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1.5px;margin-top:3.5rem;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;}
  .service-card{background:var(--gray2);padding:2rem 1.8rem;transition:background .2s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .service-card:hover{background:#333;}
  .service-icon{font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;}
  .service-card h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.6rem;}
  .service-card p{font-size:.87rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.55);line-height:1.6;}
  .service-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lime);}
  .coming-soon-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-top:3rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;}
  .coming-soon-label .cs-badge{background:rgba(0,102,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(0,102,255,.4);color:var(--blue);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap;}
  .coming-soon-label .cs-line{flex:1;height:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);}
  .coming-soon-label p{font-size:.8rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.35);white-space:nowrap;}
  .services-grid-soon{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1.5px;border:1.5px solid rgba(0,102,255,.12);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;}
  .service-card-soon{background:rgba(0,102,255,.04);padding:2rem 1.8rem;position:relative;}
  .service-card-soon .service-icon{opacity:.5;}
  .service-card-soon h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.6rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);}
  .service-card-soon p{font-size:.87rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.35);line-height:1.6;}
  .soon-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);opacity:.7;}

  /* PORTFOLIO */
  #portfolio{background:var(--black);}
  .portfolio-tabs{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:2.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .ptab{background:var(--gray2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:rgba(245,240,232,.55);font-family:'Outfit',sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
  .ptab.active,.ptab:hover{background:var(--coral);border-color:var(--coral);color:white;}

  /* REELS GRID */
  .reels-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem;}
  .reel-card{position:relative;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:9/16;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gray2) 0%,#1a1a2e 100%);cursor:pointer;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s,border-color .2s;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .reel-card:hover{transform:scale(1.03);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5);border-color:var(--coral);}
  .reel-play{width:48px;height:48px;background:rgba(255,92,77,.15);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px solid rgba(255,92,77,.4);transition:all .2s;margin-bottom:.8rem;}
  .reel-card:hover .reel-play{background:var(--coral);border-color:var(--coral);transform:scale(1.1);}
  .reel-play svg{fill:white;width:18px;height:18px;margin-left:3px;}
  .reel-num{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;color:rgba(255,255,255,.08);position:absolute;top:.6rem;left:.8rem;line-height:1;}
  .reel-label{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;color:rgba(245,240,232,.7);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;text-align:center;padding:0 .5rem;}
  .reel-ig{font-size:.6rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.3);margin-top:.3rem;text-align:center;}
  .reel-corner{position:absolute;bottom:.6rem;right:.6rem;width:20px;height:20px;opacity:.3;}
  .reel-corner svg{fill:white;width:100%;height:100%;}

  /* DESIGN GRID */
  .design-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2rem;}
  .design-card{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);background:var(--gray2);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;}
  .design-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
  .design-img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  .design-img.tall{aspect-ratio:3/4;}
  .design-body{padding:1rem 1.2rem;}
  .design-cat{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--coral);margin-bottom:.3rem;}
  .design-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;}

  /* Portfolio section tabs content */
  .ptab-content{display:none;}
  .ptab-content.active{display:block;}

  /* WORK / CASE STUDIES */
  #work{background:var(--gray);}
  .work-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3.5rem;}
  .case-card{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);background:var(--gray2);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;}
  .case-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
  .case-thumb{height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:3rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .case-type-badge{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;color:var(--lime);border:1px solid rgba(184,255,0,.3);}
  .thumb-asset-hint{position:absolute;bottom:10px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);}
  .case-body{padding:1.5rem;}
  .case-client{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--coral);margin-bottom:.4rem;}
  .case-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.6rem;}
  .case-desc{font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.55);line-height:1.6;}
  .case-results{margin-top:1rem;display:flex;gap:.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .result-pill{background:rgba(184,255,0,.08);border:1px solid rgba(184,255,0,.2);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--lime);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;min-width:80px;}
  .result-pill .rnum{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;}
  .result-pill .rlabel{font-size:.65rem;font-weight:500;color:rgba(184,255,0,.6);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;}
  .case-tags{margin-top:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;}
  .tag{font-size:.7rem;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:rgba(245,240,232,.6);}

  /* PRICING */
  #pricing{background:var(--black);}
  .pricing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3.5rem;}
  .price-card{background:var(--gray2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:12px;padding:2rem 1.8rem;position:relative;transition:transform .2s;}
  .price-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);}
  .price-card.featured{border-color:var(--coral);}
  .featured-badge{position:absolute;top:-1px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--coral);color:white;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;}
  .price-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.4rem;}
  .price-amount{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--lime);margin:.8rem 0;}
  .price-desc{font-size:.83rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.5);margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.5;}
  .price-features{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem;}
  .price-features li{font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.7);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.5rem;}
  .price-features li::before{content:'→';color:var(--coral);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
  .price-cta{margin-top:1.8rem;width:100%;text-align:center;}

  /* CONTACT */
  #contact{background:var(--gray);}
  .contact-inner{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;}
  .contact-inner p{margin-top:1rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.55);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;}
  .contact-options{margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;align-items:center;}
  .contact-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;background:var(--gray2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:1rem 2rem;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--cream);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;transition:all .2s;width:100%;max-width:360px;justify-content:center;}
  .contact-link:hover{border-color:var(--coral);color:var(--coral);}
  .contact-link .cicon{font-size:1.2rem;}

  /* FOOTER */
  footer{background:var(--black);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);padding:2rem 2.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;}
  .footer-logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.1rem;}
  .footer-logo span{color:var(--coral);}
  footer p{font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(245,240,232,.35);}

  @media(max-width:640px){
    nav{padding:1rem 1.2rem;}
    .nav-links{display:none;}
    section{padding:4rem 1.2rem;}
    #hero{padding:7rem 1.2rem 4rem;}
    .hero-stats{gap:2rem;}
    footer{padding:1.5rem 1.2rem;text-align:center;justify-content:center;}
    .reels-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(140px,1fr));}
  }
  .lang-en [data-es]{display:none!important;}
  .lang-es [data-en]{display:none!important;}
</style>
</head>
<body class="lang-en">

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="logo">Foocus<span>.</span></div>
  <div class="nav-right">
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#services" data-en>Services</a><a href="#services" data-es>Servicios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#portfolio" data-en>Work</a><a href="#portfolio" data-es>Trabajo</a></li>
      <li><a href="#work" data-en>Cases</a><a href="#work" data-es>Casos</a></li>
      <li><a href="#pricing" data-en>Pricing</a><a href="#pricing" data-es>Precios</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact" data-en>Contact</a><a href="#contact" data-es>Contacto</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="lang-toggle">
      <button class="lang-btn active" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
      <button class="lang-btn" onclick="setLang('es')">ES</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="max-w">
    <div class="hero-tag" data-en>Marketing Agency · Houston, TX</div>
    <div class="hero-tag" data-es>Agencia de Marketing · Houston, TX</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title" data-en>We make brands<br><span class="accent">impossible</span> to <span class="accent2">ignore.</span></h1>
    <h1 class="hero-title" data-es>Hacemos marcas<br><span class="accent">imposibles</span> de <span class="accent2">ignorar.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" data-en>Foocus Ag is a full-service creative marketing agency specializing in social media, video production, brand identity, and content strategy.</p>
    <p class="hero-sub" data-es>Foocus Ag es una agencia creativa de marketing especializada en redes sociales, producción de video, identidad de marca y estrategia de contenido.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="https://wa.me/13468273976" target="_blank" class="btn-primary" data-en>Let's Talk →</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/13468273976" target="_blank" class="btn-primary" data-es>Hablemos →</a>
      <a href="#portfolio" class="btn-outline" data-en>See Our Work</a>
      <a href="#portfolio" class="btn-outline" data-es>Ver Trabajo</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">15+</div><div class="stat-label" data-en>Brands Elevated</div><div class="stat-label" data-es>Marcas Transformadas</div></div>
      <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">3M+</div><div class="stat-label" data-en>Organic Reach</div><div class="stat-label" data-es>Alcance Orgánico</div></div>
      <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">100%</div><div class="stat-label" data-en>Client Retention</div><div class="stat-label" data-es>Retención de Clientes</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section id="services">
  <div class="max-w">
    <div class="section-label" data-en>What We Do</div>
    <div class="section-label" data-es>Lo Que Hacemos</div>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-en>Every angle of your<br>brand, covered.</h2>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-es>Cada ángulo de tu<br>marca, cubierto.</h2>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">📱</div>
        <h3 data-en>Social Media Management</h3><h3 data-es>Gestión de Redes Sociales</h3>
        <p data-en>Monthly strategy, content calendar, caption writing, scheduling, and community management across Meta platforms.</p>
        <p data-es>Estrategia mensual, calendario de contenido, captions, programación y gestión de comunidad en plataformas Meta.</p>
        <span class="service-tag">WhatsApp · Instagram · Facebook</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🎬</div>
        <h3 data-en>Video Production</h3><h3 data-es>Producción de Video</h3>
        <p data-en>Full-service video from concept to screen — scripting, directing, shooting, and editing for reels, ads, and brand content.</p>
        <p data-es>Video completo de concepto a pantalla — scripting, dirección, grabación y edición para reels, anuncios y contenido de marca.</p>
        <span class="service-tag" data-en>Reels · Brand Films · Ads</span><span class="service-tag" data-es>Reels · Brand Films · Anuncios</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">✂️</div>
        <h3 data-en>Video Editing</h3><h3 data-es>Edición de Video</h3>
        <p data-en>Professional editing for existing footage — color grading, captions, sound design, transitions, and platform-optimized exports.</p>
        <p data-es>Edición profesional de material existente — corrección de color, captions, diseño de sonido y exportaciones optimizadas.</p>
        <span class="service-tag" data-en>Reels · Cuts · Post-production</span><span class="service-tag" data-es>Reels · Cortes · Post-producción</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">✦</div>
        <h3 data-en>Brand Identity & Design</h3><h3 data-es>Identidad de Marca y Diseño</h3>
        <p data-en>Logo systems, color palettes, typography, brand guidelines, and visual assets that make you recognizable across every platform.</p>
        <p data-es>Sistemas de logo, paletas, tipografía, guías de marca y activos visuales que te hacen reconocible en toda plataforma.</p>
        <span class="service-tag" data-en>Logo · Guidelines · Assets</span><span class="service-tag" data-es>Logo · Guías · Activos</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">📊</div>
        <h3 data-en>Content Strategy</h3><h3 data-es>Estrategia de Contenido</h3>
        <p data-en>Data-informed content plans designed to grow your audience, increase engagement, and convert followers into paying customers.</p>
        <p data-es>Planes de contenido basados en datos para crecer tu audiencia, aumentar el engagement y convertir seguidores en clientes.</p>
        <span class="service-tag" data-en>Growth · Engagement · Conversion</span><span class="service-tag" data-es>Crecimiento · Engagement · Conversión</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3 data-en>Paid Ads (Meta)</h3><h3 data-es>Publicidad Pagada (Meta)</h3>
        <p data-en>Campaign strategy, creative direction, and ad management on Facebook and Instagram — built to convert, not just reach.</p>
        <p data-es>Estrategia de campaña, dirección creativa y gestión de anuncios en Facebook e Instagram — construidos para convertir.</p>
        <span class="service-tag">FB Ads · IG Ads · Retargeting</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🤝</div>
        <h3 data-en>Content Creation & Collabs</h3><h3 data-es>Creación de Contenido y Colaboraciones</h3>
        <p data-en>Paid and exchange collaborations with brands through Foocus Ag's personal brand — authentic content that reaches real audiences.</p>
        <p data-es>Colaboraciones pagas y de intercambio con marcas a través de la marca personal de Foocus Ag — contenido auténtico para audiencias reales.</p>
        <span class="service-tag" data-en>Brand Collabs · Sponsored · UGC</span><span class="service-tag" data-es>Colaboraciones · Patrocinados · UGC</span>
      </div>
    </div>

